From: Justin <justurn@live.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 04:48:50 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat: hunter marks before the pull and kites snared targets
 (F-219)

- Hunter's Mark first, once per target, before any shot
- KillRequest kite_auras: when the only attacker is within 8.5 yd and wears
  one of these snares (Concussive Shot, Wing Clip), step back 10 yd (at most
  every 2 s) instead of trading melee; KillResult reports kites
- Wing Clip in the melee rotation (level 12) to re-snare

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
